eight":38},{"text":"기법을","x":1280,"y":1738,"width":113,"height":39},{"text":"제공한다.","x":1408,"y":1738,"width":158,"height":39},{"text":"그러나","x":1586,"y":1733,"width":115,"height":42},{"text":"일반","x":1720,"y":1733,"width":71,"height":39}]},{"text":"파이프는 오로지 프로세스들이 서로 통신하는 동안에만 존재한다. UNIX와 Windows","words":[{"text":"파이프는","x":327,"y":1802,"width":147,"height":39},{"text":"오로지","x":488,"y":1803,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스들이","x":608,"y":1803,"width":207,"height":39},{"text":"서로","x":835,"y":1803,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"통신하는","x":921,"y":1802,"width":150,"height":39},{"text":"동안에만","x":1086,"y":1803,"width":154,"height":38},{"text":"존재한다.","x":1254,"y":1804,"width":162,"height":38},{"text":"UNIX와","x":1436,"y":1802,"width":157,"height":39},{"text":"Windows","x":1608,"y":1803,"width":183,"height":33}]},{"text":"시스템 모두에서 프로세스들이 통신을 마치고 종료하면 일반 파이프는 없어지게 된다.","words":[{"text":"시스템","x":327,"y":1868,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"모두에서","x":449,"y":1869,"width":138,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스들이","x":605,"y":1869,"width":205,"height":39},{"text":"통신을","x":827,"y":1869,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"마치고","x":949,"y":1868,"width":110,"height":40},{"text":"종료하면","x":1072,"y":1868,"width":151,"height":39},{"text":"일반","x":1241,"y":1869,"width":76,"height":38},{"text":"파이프는","x":1329,"y":1869,"width":156,"height":38},{"text":"없어지게","x":1501,"y":1867,"width":148,"height":40},{"text":"된다.","x":1668,"y":1866,"width":83,"height":39}]},{"text":"지명 파이프(named pipes)는 좀 더 강력한 통신 도구를 제공한다. 통신은 양방향","words":[{"text":"지명","x":396,"y":1935,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"파이프(named","x":483,"y":1935,"width":242,"height":43},{"text":"pipes)는","x":741,"y":1937,"width":147,"height":44},{"text":"좀","x":903,"y":1937,"width":37,"height":36},{"text":"더","x":957,"y":1935,"width":29,"height":39},{"text":"강력한","x":1008,"y":1934,"width":112,"height":39},{"text":"통신","x":1135,"y":1934,"width":75,"height":39},{"text":"도구를","x":1227,"y":1936,"width":117,"height":37},{"text":"제공한다.","x":1361,"y":1934,"width":163,"height":39},{"text":"통신은","x":1544,"y":1934,"width":118,"height":38},{"text":"양방향","x":1680,"y":1932,"width":113,"height":39}]},{"text":"0 기능하며 부모-자식 관계도 필요로 하지 않는다. 지명 파이프가구축되면 여러 프","words":[{"text":"0","x":332,"y":2003,"width":21,"height":19},{"text":"기능하며","x":414,"y":2000,"width":139,"height":41},{"text":"부모-자식","x":572,"y":2001,"width":166,"height":40},{"text":"관계도","x":756,"y":2001,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"필요로","x":878,"y":2001,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"하지","x":999,"y":2000,"width":68,"height":40},{"text":"않는다.","x":1088,"y":2000,"width":119,"height":39},{"text":"지명","x":1228,"y":2001,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"파이프가구축되면","x":1319,"y":1999,"width":327,"height":40},{"text":"여러","x":1665,"y":1997,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"프","x":1756,"y":2002,"width":37,"height":28}]},{"text":"로세스들이 이를 시용하여 통신할 수 있다. 실제 통상의 시나리오에서 지명 파이프는 다","words":[{"text":"로세스들이","x":323,"y":2066,"width":180,"height":41},{"text":"이를","x":523,"y":2068,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"시용하여","x":607,"y":2068,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"통신할","x":760,"y":2067,"width":106,"height":40},{"text":"수","x":878,"y":2067,"width":36,"height":39},{"text":"있다.","x":931,"y":2067,"width":76,"height":39},{"text":"실제","x":1025,"y":2066,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"통상의","x":1112,"y":2066,"width":111,"height":40},{"text":"시나리오에서","x":1243,"y":2066,"width":228,"height":40},{"text":"지명","x":1493,"y":2066,"width":72,"height":40},{"text":"파이프는","x":1584,"y":2065,"width":159,"height":40},{"text":"다","x":1757,"y":2064,"width":37,"height":39}]},{"text":"수의 writer를 가진다. 추가로 통신 프로세스가 종료하더라도 지명 파이프는 계속 존재","words":[{"text":"수의","x":323,"y":2134,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"writer를","x":411,"y":2136,"width":151,"height":36},{"text":"가진다.","x":578,"y":2134,"width":112,"height":39},{"text":"추가로","x":707,"y":2134,"width":105,"height":40},{"text":"통신","x":826,"y":2134,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스가","x":912,"y":2133,"width":182,"height":40},{"text":"종료하더라도","x":1107,"y":2133,"width":231,"height":40},{"text":"지명","x":1356,"y":2133,"width":72,"height":40},{"text":"파이프는","x":1448,"y":2133,"width":160,"height":39},{"text":"계속","x":1625,"y":2132,"width":78,"height":39},{"text":"존재","x":1717,"y":2130,"width":73,"height":39}]},{"text":"하게 된다. UNIX와 Windows 시스템은 구현상에 차이점은 있지만 모두 지명 파이프","words":[{"text":"하게","x":324,"y":2200,"width":69,"height":40},{"text":"된다.","x":413,"y":2200,"width":79,"height":39},{"text":"UNIX와","x":510,"y":2201,"width":146,"height":39},{"text":"Windows","x":669,"y":2204,"width":170,"height":32},{"text":"시스템은","x":857,"y":2200,"width":142,"height":40},{"text":"구현상에","x":1014,"y":2200,"width":145,"height":40},{"text":"차이점은","x":1179,"y":2200,"width":155,"height":40},{"text":"있지만","x":1353,"y":2200,"width":117,"height":40},{"text":"모두","x":1485,"y":2202,"width":80,"height":37},{"text":"지명","x":1584,"y":2198,"width":72,"height":40},{"text":"파이프","x":1678,"y":2196,"width":116,"height":41}]},{"text":"를 지원한다. 다음으로 각 시스템의 지명 파이프를 살펴본다.","words":[{"text":"를","x":323,"y":2269,"width":37,"height":37},{"text":"지원한다.","x":374,"y":2266,"width":150,"height":40},{"text":"다음으로","x":541,"y":2267,"width":142,"height":39},{"text":"각","x":696,"y":2267,"width":36,"height":39},{"text":"시스템의","x":744,"y":2267,"width":136,"height":40},{"text":"지명","x":898,"y":2267,"width":65,"height":40},{"text":"파이프를","x":981,"y":2267,"width":146,"height":40},{"text":"살펴본다.","x":1139,"y":2267,"width":162,"height":40}]},{"text":"지명 파이프를 UNIX에서는 FIFO라고 부른다. 생성되면 지명 파이프는 파일 시스","words":[{"text":"지명","x":393,"y":2333,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"파이프를","x":478,"y":2333,"width":143,"height":40},{"text":"UNIX에서는","x":635,"y":2333,"width":213,"height":40},{"text":"FIFO라고","x":862,"y":2334,"width":164,"height":39},{"text":"부른다.","x":1042,"y":2334,"width":118,"height":39},{"text":"생성되면","x":1180,"y":2333,"width":152,"height":40},{"text":"지명","x":1352,"y":2333,"width":72,"height":40},{"text":"파이프는","x":1445,"y":2333,"width":161,"height":41},{"text":"파일","x":1622,"y":2330,"width":77,"height":41},{"text":"시스","x":1718,"y":2330,"width":76,"height":40}]},{"text":"템의 보통 파일처럼 존재한다. FIFO는 mkfifo() 시스템 콜을 이용하여 생성되고 일반","words":[{"text":"템의","x":326,"y":2400,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"보통","x":409,"y":2401,"width":72,"height":37},{"text":"파일처럼","x":495,"y":2399,"width":136,"height":40},{"text":"존재한다.","x":649,"y":2400,"width":149,"height":39},{"text":"FIFO는","x":814,"y":2403,"width":128,"height":35},{"text":"mkfifo()","x":953,"y":2403,"width":172,"height":34},{"text":"시스템","x":1148,"y":2400,"width":109,"height":39},{"text":"콜을","x":1275,"y":2400,"width":79,"height":38},{"text":"이용하여","x":1370,"y":2400,"width":152,"height":39},{"text":"생성되고","x":1544,"y":2398,"width":159,"height":40},{"text":"일반","x":1721,"y":2396,"width":74,"height":39}]},{"text":"적인 open(), read(), write() 및 close() 시스템 콜로 조작된다. 명시적으로 파일","words":[{"text":"적인","x":328,"y":2465,"width":66,"height":40},{"text":"open(),","x":410,"y":2468,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"read(),","x":561,"y":2468,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"write()","x":714,"y":2469,"width":143,"height":33},{"text":"및","x":880,"y":2466,"width":31,"height":39},{"text":"close()","x":929,"y":2469,"width":145,"height":33},{"text":"시스템","x":1097,"y":2466,"width":108,"height":39},{"text":"콜로","x":1224,"y":2468,"width":76,"height":36},{"text":"조작된다.","x":1315,"y":2465,"width":167,"height":39},{"text":"명시적으로","x":1504,"y":2464,"width":198,"height":40},{"text":"파일","x":1717,"y":2461,"width":74,"height":41}]},{"text":"시스템에서 삭제될 때까지 존재하게 된다. FIFO가 양방향 통신을 허용하기는 하지만 반","words":[{"text":"시스템에서","x":328,"y":2531,"width":168,"height":40},{"text":"삭제될","x":513,"y":2531,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"때까지","x":633,"y":2530,"width":101,"height":41},{"text":"존재하게","x":750,"y":2531,"width":140,"height":40},{"text":"된다.","x":907,"y":2532,"width":78,"height":39},{"text":"FIFO가","x":1002,"y":2531,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"양방향","x":1148,"y":2531,"width":114,"height":39},{"text":"통신을","x":1275,"y":2531,"width":119,"height":39},{"text":"허용하기는","x":1409,"y":2530,"width":199,"height":40},{"text":"하지만","x":1623,"y":2528,"width":121,"height":41},{"text":"반","x":1757,"y":2527,"width":37,"height":39}]},{"text":"이중 전송만이 기능하다. 데이터가 양방향으로 전송될 필요가 있다면, 보통 2개의 FIFO","words":[{"text":"이중","x":330,"y":2598,"width":67,"height":40},{"text":"전송만이","x":410,"y":2596,"width":134,"height":41},{"text":"기능하다.","x":563,"y":2596,"width":146,"height":41},{"text":"데이터가","x":728,"y":2597,"width":141,"height":40},{"text":"양방향으로","x":884,"y":2597,"width":179,"height":40},{"text":"전송될","x":1079,"y":2596,"width":108,"height":39},{"text":"필요가","x":1206,"y":2596,"width":116,"height":40},{"text":"있다면,","x":1338,"y":2596,"width":125,"height":42},{"text":"보통","x":1481,"y":2598,"width":81,"height":38},{"text":"2개의","x":1576,"y":2595,"width":100,"height":41},{"text":"FIFO","x":1694,"y":2597,"width":99,"height":33}]},{"text":"가 시용된다. 부가적으로 통신하는 두 프로세스는 동일한 기계 내에 존재해야 한다. 서로","words":[{"text":"가","x":330,"y":2664,"width":33,"height":39},{"text":"시용된다.","x":374,"y":2662,"width":145,"height":40},{"text":"부가적으로","x":534,"y":2663,"width":176,"height":40},{"text":"통신하는","x":722,"y":2663,"width":143,"height":40},{"text":"두","x":877,"y":2665,"width":36,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스는","x":926,"y":2662,"width":183,"height":39},{"text":"동일한","x":1121,"y":2661,"width":116,"height":39},{"text":"기계","x":1252,"y":2662,"width":72,"height":39},{"text":"내에","x":1344,"y":2661,"width":73,"height":40},{"text":"존재해야","x":1434,"y":2663,"width":163,"height":40},{"text":"한다.","x":1609,"y":2662,"width":90,"height":41},{"text":"서로","x":1717,"y":2661,"width":76,"height":41}]}]}